# Subject: TOOL REPLIES — SOCIAL REJECTED.
language EN
namespace hoomans

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.rejected.generic
  say [default] as 1:
    "Not right now."
    "I'm not up for that."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.rejected.hostile_abuse
  say [default] as 1:
    "Back off. I'm not putting up with that."
    "Watch your mouth—we're done talking."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.rejected.orientation_gate
  say [default] as 1:
    "Sorry, I don't feel that way about you."
    "That's not really who I'm into—let's keep it friendly."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.rejected.personality_gate
  say [default] as 1:
    "That's just not my style."
    "I'm not the right person for that."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.rejected.positive_cooldown_active
  say [default] as 1:
    "Easy, we already went through that today—ask me again tomorrow."
    "Slow down, we've had enough of that for today."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.rejected.rejected_by_game
  say [default] as 1:
    "I can't do that right now."
    "Now's not the time for that."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.rejected.relationship_gate
  say [default] as 1:
    "We don't know each other well enough for that yet."
    "Slow down—we're not that close yet."

dialogue semantic.tool_reply.social.rejected.sexual_advance
  say [default] as 1:
    "Not happening. Don't talk to me like that."
    "Whoa—way too fast. That's not happening."
    "Don't talk to me like that. Back off."
